#: ../../source/is2_README.md:1
msgid "is2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/is2_README.md:3
msgid ""
"is2 is a type-checking module for JavaScript to test values. Is does not "
"throw exceptions and every function only returns true or false. Use is2 "
"to validate types in your node.js code. Every function in is2 returns "
"either true of false."
msgstr ""

